---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';import Chart from '../components/Chart.astro';import {evidence,url,display,source} from '../lib/data';
import CompareChart from '../components/CompareChart.astro';
import derived from '../../data/processed/derived_observations.json';
const datasets=[...new Set(evidence.observations.map((r:any)=>r.dataset))] as string[];
const annual=datasets.filter(d=>!d.includes('USSC')&&!d.includes('GAO-16')&&!d.includes('snapshot'));
const nonannual=evidence.observations.filter((r:any)=>!annual.includes(r.dataset));
---
<Layout title="Measured evidence"><div class="eyebrow">Measured quantities · documented limits</div><h1>What happened afterward?</h1><p class="lede">These records show reported research use, inspections, enforcement and trade. Each has its own population and unit. None is a national count of animal suffering prevented.</p><div class="notice">These are descriptive analyses. Reporting changes, targeted inspections, private practices and concurrent policies prevent attributing these trends to a president or law. No causal model is fitted to this evidence.</div><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={url('data/observations.csv')} download>Download all observed values</a><a class="button secondary" href={url('data/analysis.json')} download>Download calculated comparisons</a></div>
<section class="section"><h2>Reported research use declined in these covered groups</h2><CompareChart rows={derived.filter(r=>r.dataset==='Reported research use: C + D + E')} title="Reported animals used: dogs, cats and nonhuman primates" caption="Use is C + D + E; animals held but not used (B) are excluded. The comparison is not a fixed facility cohort and does not establish a causal effect of FDA reform. Most purpose-bred rodents, purpose-bred birds and noncovered species are absent."/></section>
<section class="section"><h2>Inspection conditions change what is detected</h2><CompareChart rows={derived.filter(r=>r.dataset==='Horse noncompliances per 100 inspected entries')} title="Performance-horse noncompliances by inspection group" caption="DQP means an industry-designated inspector. The recorded rate was higher with APHIS present than absent in each displayed year. Shows and entries were selected, not randomized; the contrast is not a causal estimate or national prevalence. Groups may overlap, and entries are not unique horses."/></section>
{annual.map((dataset,index)=>{const data=evidence.observations.filter((r:any)=>r.dataset===dataset);const series=[...new Set(data.map((r:any)=>r.series))] as string[];return <section class="section" data-chart-group><div class="chart-header"><h2>{dataset}</h2><span class="tag">{series.length} measures</span></div><label class="control chart-control">Measure<select data-chart-select aria-label={`Measure for ${dataset}`}>{series.map((s,i)=><option value={i}>{s}</option>)}</select></label>{series.map((s,i)=><div data-series-panel={i} hidden={i!==0}><Chart rows={data.filter((r:any)=>r.series===s).sort((a:any,b:any)=>a.year-b.year)} title={s}/></div>)}</section>})}
<section class="section"><h2>Snapshots and pooled periods</h2><p>These observations are not annual trends. A period-ending year must not be mistaken for a one-year count.</p><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Measure</th><th>Value</th><th>Population and coverage</th><th>Source</th></tr></thead><tbody>{nonannual.map((r:any)=><tr><td>{r.series}</td><td>{display(r.value)} {r.unit}</td><td>{r.denominatorDescription}<br/>{r.notes}</td><td><a href={source(r.sourceId)?.url}>{source(r.sourceId)?.title}</a><br/>{r.locator}</td></tr>)}</tbody></table></div></section>
<section class="section"><h2>A direct welfare measure, with an attribution limit</h2><p class="prose">A published survey of 22 slaughter plants found that 20 rendered all observed cattle insensible before hoisting. This measures a practice closely related to suffering. The study evaluated private buyer audits and did not isolate a federal policy effect. Its 2000 publication date does not turn its findings into a Clinton-administration accomplishment. <a href="https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/22570895/">Grandin, JAVMA (2000), abstract and results</a>.</p></section>
<script>document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-chart-group]').forEach(group=>{group.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('select')!.addEventListener('change',e=>{const value=(e.target as HTMLSelectElement).value;group.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-series-panel]').forEach(panel=>panel.hidden=panel.dataset.seriesPanel!==value)})});</script></Layout>
